message: "Cite the exact frozen software release used. The associated AUT manuscript is unpublished; do not cite it as a published journal article. Cite the previously published 2025 VELE definition separately where appropriate."
title: "VELE Power-Grid Structural Observability and Certified Electrical Cut Evidence"
type: software
