version: "2.1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-03
abstract: "A reproducible, source-rated power-grid evidence package for studying the observability limits of the previously published vertex eccentricity labeled energy invariant. The repository includes historical six-system MATPOWER/DC proxy evidence and pinned PGLib-OPF v23.07 physical circuit capacity-cut lower bounds for 536 cases, with 13 connected positively certified stressed IEEE118 outages. Four connected certified cases have unchanged VELE. The final review freeze incorporates source-verifiable scientific figures and does not claim AC optimality, a new graph invariant, or a published manuscript."
keywords:
  - power-grid contingencies
  - structural observability
  - spectral graph theory
  - MATPOWER
  - capacity-cut necessary bounds
  - reproducibility
